{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-54195-r4587209","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Nut Roast","sourcePageId":54195,"sourceRevision":"4587209","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-10-26T23:28:17Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Codename Noreste","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Nut%20Roast&oldid=4587209","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:09:32.266Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for pastries","Category:Recipes using bread crumb","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using lemon juice","Category:Recipes using margarine","Category:Recipes using nuts and seeds","Category:Recipes using puff pastry","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Vegetarian recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"6bd6bb1777bfd18cf63b385106da73ed4a80662a76d51db7f5e1246693caf424","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Recipes for pastries\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\n== Ingredients ==\n=== Nut roast ===\n* 1 large [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]], [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Ounce|oz]] [[Cookbook:Margarine|margarine]]\n* 8 oz [[Cookbook:Brazil Nut|Brazil nuts]]\n* 4 oz [[Cookbook:Bread Crumb|breadcrumbs]]\n* 1 ½ [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Lemon Juice|lemon juice]]\n* ¼ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] dried [[Cookbook:Thyme|thyme]]\n* ¼ tsp [[Cookbook:Mixed Spice|mixed spice]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Egg|egg]]\n* [[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]\n* [[Cookbook:Pepper|Pepper]]\n\n=== Stuffing ===\n* 4 oz [[Cookbook:Bread Crumb|breadcrumbs]]\n* 1 tbsp chopped onion\n* 0.5 oz chopped [[Cookbook:Parsley|parsley]]\n* 2 tsp lemon juice\n* 1.5 oz margarine\n* Salt\n* Pepper\n\n=== Assembly ===\n\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Pound|lb]] [[Cookbook:Puff Pastry|puff pastry]]\n* Pastry holly leaves\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n=== Nut roast ===\n# [[Cookbook:Frying|Fry]] the chopped onion in margarine for 10 minutes until soft.\n# Put this in a bowl with the rest of the nut roast ingredients.\n\n=== Stuffing ===\n# Mix all of the stuffing ingredients in a bowl to make a soft mixture that holds together.\n# Season to taste with salt.\n\n=== Assembly ===\n\n# Preheat the [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to 200°C.\n# [[Cookbook:Dough#Rolling|Roll out]] the puff pastry on a lightly-floured surface.\n# Form the stuffing into a 5 inch-long sausage shape, and place it in the middle of the pastry.\n# Pile the nut roast mixture on top of the stuffing.\n# Fold the ends of the pastry to completely enclose the mixture. Tuck in the ends.\n# Decorate with pastry holly leaves and make a lattice design on top.\n# Place on a damp [[Cookbook:Baking Sheet|baking sheet]], join side down.\n# [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] for 30 minutes in the preheated oven until crisp.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using nuts and seeds]]\n[[Category:Vegetarian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for pastries]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bread crumb]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using puff pastry]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using margarine]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Nut Roast","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 large onion, chopped","sourceTe